{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半区左侧第一段白色大字，字号最大、亮度最高，位置靠上且首先进入视线；随后第二段白色大字也很容易吸引注意。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"大致看出他正处于两个人亲近相处的状态，暂时不想考虑以后，只想享受当下；更具体的处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、放松、陶醉。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他其实还想告诉对方自己有多喜欢这种相处，也想确认对方是否有同样的感受，但没想好如何开口，念头最终淡去。第二段体现的犹豫、牵绊和难以表达，第一眼不容易完整抓到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两段白色大字字号、亮度接近，都有很强的视觉权重，第二段也在争夺主视线。\",\n    \"第一段主句较长，需要顺着读完，才能明确理解不考虑未来与享受当下亲近之间的关系。\",\n    \"核心情绪线索分布在两段文字及各自下方的彩色短语中，需要在多个区域之间寻找和对应。\",\n    \"第二段本身包含喜欢、想确认对方心意、犹豫开口、念头消退等多个层次，快速扫视难以一次拿全。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7f57b5b3-bf8c-45e5-809c-746a94f62f20", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T025930253052Z", "elapsed_seconds": 52.437, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:00:22.691542+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3dbc83eed236b503eb1c01927165effa150e181acd0a9988ec119a0af7b45b7a", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\